Z||000000||Tweek||06-16-2001||11:17 PM||||I was only there for about 45 minutes...  But I tool a bunch of pics. My camera is kinda low quality, but here you go if you want to see em. I'll take some time to do thumbnails later... kinda tired right now.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.oswg.net/Ted/shows/oob/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.oswg.net/Ted/shows/oob/</A> <P>One guy drove to the show in a convertable Indy, but didnt put it in the show. It is the pic ending with ...0028.jpg<P>btw, if anyones car is up there and wants it taken down, just let me know!<P>------------------<BR><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.oswg.net/Ted/tweek.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Two88GTs||06-17-2001||02:07 AM||||Great show!  I drove up my red 88GT there (I recently replaced the TCC solenoid) and got 25.4 mpg with my 3-speed auto and 3.33 gears despite both windows being rolled down and some sustained runs at 80mph.  The best part was talking to a tollbooth operator on I-195 after the show who asked me quizzically, "Was there a Fiero rally or something today? I must have seen at least 20 of them."||||reg||1
