Z||000008||Two88GTs||06-19-2001||11:13 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 88CoupeV6:<BR><B>I had a great day other than the sunburn I received. I have to upload my pics and I will post them to my Photopoint album. Nice to talk to you again Two88GTs, Hope to see you at our NEFA swap meet next month. There were a lot of sweet cars there. 2 had V8's. what a nice location too. It was directly in the middle of all the tourist areas.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>The feeling is mutual, and yes, I do plan to be there at the swap meet next month as my grage is piling up with Fiero related parts.<BR>For example, I have FIVE Fiero seats in the garage!<P>Tweek, the TCC should take 2-3 hours: jack up rear, remove left rear wheel, partially remove inner fender, remove side tranny pan.<BR>TCC comes off with a T-30.  Email me if you need more detailed instructions.<P>||||reg||1
